      "title": "🔍 Guide: 8K 360° Panorama UltraSharp Upscaler (4x + Seam Fix)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ⚡ 8K 360° Panorama UltraSharp Super-Resolution\n\nHigh-frequency, texture-preserving 4× neural super-resolution for massive **33.5 Megapixel** 360° VR skyboxes!\n\n### ⚙️ Pipeline Specifications\n• **Upscale Model**: `4x-UltraSharp.pth` by Kim2091 (Official photographic sharpening model)\n• **Why UltraSharp over RealESRGAN?**: RealESRGAN 4× has an aggressive de-noising penalty that wipes out micro-textures and smears natural foliage/grass into soft watercolor blobs. `4x-UltraSharp` preserves razor-sharp grass stalks, crisp pine needles, rock fractures, and sparkling water ripples!\n• **Direct 4× Scaling ($2K \\to 8K$)**: Scales native $2048 \\times 1024$ input directly to massive **$8192 \\times 4096$ (8K Ultra VR 2:1)** in ~8–14 seconds.\n• **5% Toroidal Boundary Seam Wrap (`seamless_boundary: true`)**: Clones 5% opposite margins across edges during the neural model pass, ensuring the $0^\\circ / 360^\\circ$ wrap line is 100% seamless without vertical stitch lines.\n• **Interactive 360° VR Viewer**: Drag with the mouse to inspect sharp textures anywhere in the 8K world directly in ComfyUI.\n• **Metadata Export**: Injects standard Google Photo Sphere XMP metadata so output PNG/JPG automatically triggers 360° VR playback on VR headsets, Google, and Facebook.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start Instructions\n1. Drop any generated 2K panorama (from our generation workflow) into **[Input 2K Panorama Image]**.\n2. Ensure `4x-UltraSharp.pth` is selected in **[Load Upscale Model]**.\n3. Click **Queue Prompt**: your 8K ($8192 \\times 4096$) equirectangular panorama will be ready in seconds!"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# ⚡ 8K 360° Panorama UltraSharp Super-Resolution\n\nHigh-frequency 4× neural super-resolution for massive 33.5 Megapixel 360° VR skyboxes!\n\n• **Model**: `4x-UltraSharp.pth`\n• **Resolution**: 2048x1024 (2K) -> 8192x4096 (8K)\n• **Seamless Seam Fix**: 5% toroidal boundary wrapping eliminates stitch lines."
      },
      "color": "#1b384f",
      "bgcolor": "#122433"
    },
